WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.400
The opponent falls after light Tatsu while Ryu recovers.

2
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:00.750
Ryu moves forward during the opponent's recovery.

3
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.050
Ryu stands close as the opponent gets up.

4
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.800
Ryu catches the waking opponent with a forward throw.

5
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.350
The opponent lands after the throw.
